    "title": "State of Washington refusing to abide by President Trump's executive order stating no biological boys in girls sports",
    "text": "Feb. 27, 2025: 5:45 p.m.:\nState of Washington refusing to abide by President Trump’s executive order stating no biological boys in girls sports\nGirl who refuses to play against biological male is accused of bullying and is being disciplined by school district.\n“There is a boy on the team. I will not be playing or participating in any part of this game.”\n15-year-old high school athlete Frances Staudt and her mother discuss the backlash she has faced for refusing to compete in a basketball game against an 18-year-old biological male.…\n[pic.twitter.com/UfwcLav21u]— Fox News (@FoxNews)\n[February 27, 2025]",
